  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://davidkoepsell.com/cfr404#ResJudicataDismissal">
    <rdfs:comment>Dismissal of a request for hearing because the same claim has already been decided. 404.957 dismisses a request for a hearing, and 404.929 makes the hearing the repair path over the reconsidered determination, so the dismissal and the hearing are competing paths over the same act.</rdfs:comment>
